    {
      "id": "i9tIK1INNpMA7xxGFTYrE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 371,
      "y": -122.5,
      "width": 431.7796630859375,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 340425318,
      "version": 440,
      "versionNonce": 436734855,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779023241499,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nRequirements\nFunctional \n1) User can search for event/show\n2) User can book ticket/seat of show\n3) User can do payment for the ticket\n\nNon-Functional\n1) Consistency >> availablity(double booking)\n2) Scalability (hit event)\n3) availability (search for events/shows)\n\nOther\n1) Fault tolerance\n2) relability\n...\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nRequirements\nFunctional \n1) User can search for event/show\n2) User can book ticket/seat of show\n3) User can do payment for the ticket\n\nNon-Functional\n1) Consistency >> availablity(double booking)\n2) Scalability (hit event)\n3) availability (search for events/shows)\n\nOther\n1) Fault tolerance\n2) relability\n...\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
