    {
      "id": "36ughQg2Uko92nSyNQ_yM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1073.25,
      "y": -100.75,
      "width": 515.0195922851562,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1556938298,
      "version": 371,
      "versionNonce": 502865737,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779023241499,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rest end points\n1) Search Event\nGet:- \n/event/search?search={search}&location={location}..\n\n1) event information\nGet :- /event/{eventId}\n\n2) reservation \npost: /event/reserve\n{\n\"showId\":\n\"ticket\":[]\n}\n\n3) confirm\npost: /event/confirm\n{\n\"ticketId\":\n\"paymentDetails\":\n}\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Rest end points\n1) Search Event\nGet:- \n/event/search?search={search}&location={location}..\n\n1) event information\nGet :- /event/{eventId}\n\n2) reservation \npost: /event/reserve\n{\n\"showId\":\n\"ticket\":[]\n}\n\n3) confirm\npost: /event/confirm\n{\n\"ticketId\":\n\"paymentDetails\":\n}\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9EOZNCq53eKz1G12Rv_L2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 348,
      "y": 471.5,
      "width": 619.5596923828125,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 651727462,
      "version": 327,
      "versionNonce": 824317383,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779023241499,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Estimation\nAssume 1M user active daily user.\n\nUser\n4 filed * 2 chars = 8 chars (32 bits) = 1 MB * 1M = 3 GB\n\nShow \n6 filed * 2 chars = 12 chars (32 bits) = 4 MB * 1M = 4 GB\n\nTicket\n9 filed * 10 chars = 90 chars (32 bits) = 100 MB * 1M = 10 GB\n\nfor small system 100Gb Oracle enough.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Estimation\nAssume 1M user active daily user.\n\nUser\n4 filed * 2 chars = 8 chars (32 bits) = 1 MB * 1M = 3 GB\n\nShow \n6 filed * 2 chars = 12 chars (32 bits) = 4 MB * 1M = 4 GB\n\nTicket\n9 filed * 10 chars = 90 chars (32 bits) = 100 MB * 1M = 10 GB\n\nfor small system 100Gb Oracle enough.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
