    {
      "id": "W8tEYWqfFibKNZUcArlCO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 344,
      "y": 901.5,
      "width": 1188.678955078125,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 677099962,
      "version": 832,
      "versionNonce": 2026512903,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779023241499,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Covered Flow (functional requriments)\n\n1) Create/read event/show/User in system.\n  -> Client -> API gateway -> event service -> oracle ( post(create) And get(read))\n2) Booking in system\n-> search specific or random show \n-> read seat/event from system\n-> do booking \n-> payment \n-> confirmation\nflow:- \nsearch event/show = client -> API -> search service -> oracle \nread event/show = Client -> API gateway -> event service -> oracle\nbooking = Client -> API gateway -> booking service -> oracle -> booking service -> client\nconfirmation =  payment = client -> api -> booking service -> stripe -> booking service -> oracle -> booking service -> client\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Covered Flow (functional requriments)\n\n1) Create/read event/show/User in system.\n  -> Client -> API gateway -> event service -> oracle ( post(create) And get(read))\n2) Booking in system\n-> search specific or random show \n-> read seat/event from system\n-> do booking \n-> payment \n-> confirmation\nflow:- \nsearch event/show = client -> API -> search service -> oracle \nread event/show = Client -> API gateway -> event service -> oracle\nbooking = Client -> API gateway -> booking service -> oracle -> booking service -> client\nconfirmation =  payment = client -> api -> booking service -> stripe -> booking service -> oracle -> booking service -> client\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
