    {
      "id": "bHh7GGu2suvdb4KzAjxBJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 876.4762704031816,
      "y": 270.57151576451065,
      "width": 451.73974609375,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b37",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1375695079,
      "version": 409,
      "versionNonce": 1818909671,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779024245565,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pros\n1) Esay to design and develop\n2) Rest calls\n3) Normal get and post calls\n\n\nCons\n1) Single point of failure. (DB, service)\n2) Not scale as unbale to handle 10M msg/day\n3) Not guarantee of msg delivery.\n4) Connection create, open and closed \ntakes time as well as consume memory and\nresources",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Pros\n1) Esay to design and develop\n2) Rest calls\n3) Normal get and post calls\n\n\nCons\n1) Single point of failure. (DB, service)\n2) Not scale as unbale to handle 10M msg/day\n3) Not guarantee of msg delivery.\n4) Connection create, open and closed \ntakes time as well as consume memory and\nresources",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Vk2U5SZxtdWZZUa32aT0X",
