      "seed": 692661641,
      "version": 466,
      "versionNonce": 2026220137,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779024487690,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rest point of view (Scaling system)\n1) DB can be single point of failure.\n-> Master slave replication to resolve this issue.\n-> Need to be sure replication should be consistent with master\n-> If master failed replication will take place of it.\n\n2) Message service\n-> We can increase instance so it will handle million users at a time.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Rest point of view (Scaling system)\n1) DB can be single point of failure.\n-> Master slave replication to resolve this issue.\n-> Need to be sure replication should be consistent with master\n-> If master failed replication will take place of it.\n\n2) Message service\n-> We can increase instance so it will handle million users at a time.\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
